      "created_at": "2014-12-22T01:06:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm not an officialy representative of GtG, but the policy I've used for the full-text spoilers sheet is that anything which has appeared in public commentary has gone in. Any information that hasn't, hasn't.&nbsp;</p><p>I hinted very, very strongly (as in, anvil-sized hints) to my wife that she needed to pre-order as Christmas present for me. One way or another, as soon as WCos and the associated mini-expansions are in my hands, I will have everything added as fast as I can type and proofread.</p>",
